Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.90,Mid,,0,0,0,,I recently handled a case
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.90,0:00:04.20,Mid,,0,0,0,,about toxic managers and employees.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.20,0:00:06.00,Mid,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:08.10,Mid,,0,0,0,,I am Dr. Hyma Prasad, psychologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:12.20,Mid,,0,0,0,,A young guy I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:13.80,Mid,,0,0,0,,who was very smart,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.80,0:00:16.30,Mid,,0,0,0,,landed a top MNC job
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.30,0:00:18.20,Mid,,0,0,0,,at a very young age.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:22.00,Mid,,0,0,0,,While he was working,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:24.30,Mid,,0,0,0,,everyone around him
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.30,0:00:26.30,Mid,,0,0,0,,was much older than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:29.10,Mid,,0,0,0,,As he performed really well
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:31.80,Mid,,0,0,0,,and excelled at his work,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:35.10,Mid,,0,0,0,,his salary got hiked regularly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:37.80,Top,,0,0,0,,Compared to others,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:40.00,Top,,0,0,0,,he earned double the salary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:42.10,Mid,,0,0,0,,Out of extreme jealousy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:44.10,Mid,,0,0,0,,they constantly criticized him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.10,0:00:47.90,Mid,,0,0,0,,He faced vulgar language,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.90,0:00:50.80,Top,,0,0,0,,abuse, and harassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.80,0:00:53.60,Top,,0,0,0,,As a result of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.60,0:00:55.70,Mid,,0,0,0,,he fell into severe depression.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.70,0:00:58.10,Mid,,0,0,0,,Then he came to me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.10,0:01:00.10,Mid,,0,0,0,,for psychological counseling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.10,0:01:02.10,Mid,,0,0,0,,When I analyzed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:04.90,Mid,,0,0,0,,why he ended up like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:07.80,Top,,0,0,0,,it was the toxic environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.80,0:01:10.00,Top,,0,0,0,,He joined enthusiastically,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:12.30,Mid,,0,0,0,,being a knowledgeable,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.30,0:01:14.50,Mid,,0,0,0,,friendly, and happy person.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.50,0:01:17.20,Mid,,0,0,0,,But their relentless push
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.20,0:01:19.20,Mid,,0,0,0,,to drive him out
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.20,0:01:21.90,Mid,,0,0,0,,severely impacted his life.
